# =============================================================================
# Results are large real-data outputs (hundreds of MB) — kept on disk but NOT
# versioned here. Curated summaries live in docs/ and ARE committed instead.
# To version a specific result deliberately, force-add it: `git add -f <path>`.
# =============================================================================
Simulated_data/results/*
TCGA_test/results/*
# ...but keep the (otherwise-empty) results/ folders in the repo so the
# directory structure stays visible:
!Simulated_data/results/.gitkeep
!Simulated_data/results/calibration_test*.out
!TCGA_test/results/.gitkeep
!TCGA_test/results/null_calibration*.out

# R session / run artifacts
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rout

docs/literature_roadmap.md
docs/noise_model_labbook.md

sync_scripts.sh